Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:41.69,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}one-shots them at incredible
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:41.69,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}speed”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,interesting problem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.68,0:00:04.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,because There are more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,crap PRs from the public
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,right? There was always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,crap, but the speed at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:10.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,which you can one-shot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,crap is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:12.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I know there's some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:14.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,clever solutions to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:14.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,this. I know Mitchell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:16.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hashimoto has an open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,source project for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:20.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,exactly this to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,effectively only allow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:22.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributors who have a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:23.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,certain trust rating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:23.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I believe he was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:25.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,using that for Ghostty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:26.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,I haven't looked into it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:26.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,myself it's an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,interesting idea right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:29.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know like you need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,some sort of reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,be able to contribute I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,think it's an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:32.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,interesting approach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,because really the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,problem is like it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,easy to put up a PR but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:36.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,now that you're putting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,work on the maintainers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:39.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and they need to they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:40.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,need to put an actual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:41.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,work to look at it
